%% LSEG Forecast Layers — build-up from deal-based (base) to aspiration (top)
%% v0.1 · conceptual · for validation · Viridian-proposed, not LSEG-ratified
%% Paste into Miro via Mermaid import. flowchart BT = foundation at bottom, output on top.
flowchart BT
  FRAME["v0.1 · Conceptual · For validation · Viridian-proposed, not LSEG-ratified"]:::frame
  DEAL["DEAL-BASED LAYER — the foundation. Values set and adjusted here, always traceable to the deal.<br/>Binary calls: Commit (default In) / Best Case (default Out) / Material Pipeline (above threshold) — full value, binary in/out.<br/>Deal-level adjustment: value override / hedge on a committed deal (stays attached to the deal)."]:::deal
  EARLY["Early Stage Pipeline Overlay — the deal-based to overlay transition point.<br/>Uses the known below-threshold tail. Levers: Timing (shift plus or minus months) / Value (unweighted total) / Win rate percent.<br/>Output = weighted and phased, traceable to the tail deals."]:::ov1
  NEW["New Deals Not in Pipeline — models deals not yet created.<br/>Drivers (each vs an actuals reference point): Added to Pipeline / Avg Deal Cycle Time / Likely Win Rate / Avg Deal Value."]:::ov2
  REN["Renewal-Based Overlay (OPEN — data-dependent, confirm with business; position overrideable).<br/>Renewals due for review. Drivers: Available to Review / Renewal percent.<br/>Output splits: renews = Gross Sales, lapses = Cancellations."]:::ren
  TGT["Target / Aspirational — simple manual input by forecast type (Gross Sales, Cancellations)."]:::tgt
  OUT["= SINGLE SUBMITTED FORECAST — one number, the sum of every layer below."]:::out
  LENS["Cross-cutting lenses (read ACROSS every layer, not layers themselves):<br/>Swing / range (worst / most-likely / best) and Budget vs forecast (path-to-plan reference)."]:::note
  AXIS["Certainty / time axis (same axis): near months (CM, CM+1) lean on lower layers (higher certainty);<br/>far months (CM+2 onward) lean on upper layers (more assumption)."]:::axis

  DEAL ==> EARLY
  EARLY ==> NEW
  NEW ==> REN
  REN ==> TGT
  TGT ==> OUT
  OUT -.- LENS
  DEAL -.- AXIS
  OUT -.- FRAME

  classDef out fill:#1E6B4E,stroke:#14503A,color:#ffffff
  classDef deal fill:#1F3864,stroke:#132444,color:#ffffff
  classDef ov1 fill:#7FA9D8,stroke:#5E82BE,color:#0F2647
  classDef ov2 fill:#AEC9EA,stroke:#5E82BE,color:#163057
  classDef ren fill:#C9DCF2,stroke:#5E82BE,color:#1F3864
  classDef tgt fill:#DCE6F5,stroke:#9FB8DC,color:#1F3864
  classDef note fill:#F4F7FC,stroke:#D3DFEE,color:#1F3864
  classDef axis fill:#E7EDF5,stroke:#C6D2E4,color:#1F3864
  classDef frame fill:#FFF7E6,stroke:#C8922E,color:#4A4423
